{
  "abstract": "This revised paper separates topology-only obstructions from representation checks and physical source theorems. It places chiral multiplicity on the internal six-manifold, reports the exact q79 smooth c3=+/-6 index candidate with its analytic promotion gate, uses integer U(1) characters, incorporates the selected finite-branch hypercharge and anomaly theorems at their declared scope, and corrects Majorana, holonomy, wave-cone, operator-selection, PQ, and one-loop beta-function claims.",
